OL,3,ACyber chiefs tell websites to make
OL,4,Acritical safety update or go offline
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisations which rely on the PHP
OL,7,Fprogramming language are being told
OL,8,Fthey should install a significant
OL,9,Fsoftware update today - or consider
OL,10,Ftaking their websites offline.
OL,12,FTwo critical vulnerabilities with PHP,
OL,13,Fwhich is widely used across the
OL,14,Finternet, have been identified.
OL,16,FThe PHP Foundation, which supports it,
OL,17,Fis issuing updates which address them
OL,18,Fon Wednesday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
