OL,3,ACyber chiefs tell websites to make
OL,4,Acritical safety update or go offline
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's National Cyber Security Centre
OL,7,F(NCSC), as well as its counterparts in
OL,8,Fthe EU and Australia have urged those
OL,9,Fwho use PHP to apply the fixes as soon
OL,10,Fas they become available.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
